For the estimations of the backgrounds using MC samples, the background process $\Pq\Paq \to \Z \Z \to 4\ell$ was generated at NLO accuracy containing
s-, t- and u-channel diagrams (Figure~\ref{fig:ZZ_feynman}) using {\sc powheg V2}~\cite{Nason:2013ydw}
and {\sc pythia8}, with the same settings as for the Higgs signal. As this simulation covers a large
range of ZZ invariant masses, dynamical QCD factorization and renormalization
scales have been chosen, equal to $m_{\Z\Z}$. 

The $\Pg\Pg \! \to \! ZZ$ process (Figure~\ref{fig:ZZ_feynman}) is simulated at leading order (LO) 
